> **NOTE:** You may want to omit <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`desiredCapacity`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`DesiredCapacity`" pulumi-lang-go="`desiredCapacity`" pulumi-lang-python="`desired_capacity`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`desiredCapacity`" pulumi-lang-java="`desiredCapacity`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`desired_capacity`">`desiredCapacity`</span> attribute from attached <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`aws.autoscaling.Group`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`aws.autoscaling.Group`" pulumi-lang-go="`autoscaling.Group`" pulumi-lang-python="`autoscaling.Group`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`aws.autoscaling.Group`" pulumi-lang-java="`aws.autoscaling.Group`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`aws_autoscaling_group`">`aws.autoscaling.Group`</span>
