> **NOTE:** This tagging resource does not use the provider <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`ignoreTags`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`IgnoreTags`" pulumi-lang-go="`ignoreTags`" pulumi-lang-python="`ignore_tags`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`ignoreTags`" pulumi-lang-java="`ignoreTags`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`ignore_tags`">`ignoreTags`</span> configuration.

