By default every namespace that CloudWatch supports is enriched. Narrow that scope with <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`includeFilter`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`IncludeFilter`" pulumi-lang-go="`includeFilter`" pulumi-lang-python="`include_filter`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`includeFilter`" pulumi-lang-java="`includeFilter`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`include_filter`">`includeFilter`</span> and <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`excludeFilter`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ExcludeFilter`" pulumi-lang-go="`excludeFilter`" pulumi-lang-python="`exclude_filter`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`excludeFilter`" pulumi-lang-java="`excludeFilter`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`exclude_filter`">`excludeFilter`</span>. The configuration below enriches all of `AWS/EC2` except two network metrics, plus exactly two `AWS/RDS` metrics, and nothing else.

