The provider is configured to ignore changes to <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`engine`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Engine`" pulumi-lang-go="`engine`" pulumi-lang-python="`engine`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`engine`" pulumi-lang-java="`engine`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`engine`">`engine`</span>, <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`engineVersion`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`EngineVersion`" pulumi-lang-go="`engineVersion`" pulumi-lang-python="`engine_version`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`engineVersion`" pulumi-lang-java="`engineVersion`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`engine_version`">`engineVersion`</span> and <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`parameterGroupName`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ParameterGroupName`" pulumi-lang-go="`parameterGroupName`" pulumi-lang-python="`parameter_group_name`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`parameterGroupName`" pulumi-lang-java="`parameterGroupName`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`parameter_group_name`">`parameterGroupName`</span> inside <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`aws.elasticache.ReplicationGroup`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`aws.elasticache.ReplicationGroup`" pulumi-lang-go="`elasticache.ReplicationGroup`" pulumi-lang-python="`elasticache.ReplicationGroup`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`aws.elasticache.ReplicationGroup`" pulumi-lang-java="`aws.elasticache.ReplicationGroup`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`aws_elasticache_replication_group`">`aws.elasticache.ReplicationGroup`</span> resources if they belong to a global replication group.

