To configure [Instance Groups](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/emr/latest/ManagementGuide/emr-instance-group-configuration.html#emr-plan-instance-groups) for [task nodes](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/emr/latest/ManagementGuide/emr-master-core-task-nodes.html#emr-plan-task), see the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`aws.emr.InstanceGroup`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`aws.emr.InstanceGroup`" pulumi-lang-go="`emr.InstanceGroup`" pulumi-lang-python="`emr.InstanceGroup`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`aws.emr.InstanceGroup`" pulumi-lang-java="`aws.emr.InstanceGroup`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`aws_emr_instance_group`">`aws.emr.InstanceGroup`</span> resource.

