### Disallow Managed IAM Policies

To automatically remove any configured managed IAM policies, set the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`policyArns`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`PolicyArns`" pulumi-lang-go="`policyArns`" pulumi-lang-python="`policy_arns`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`policyArns`" pulumi-lang-java="`policyArns`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`policy_arns`">`policyArns`</span> argument to an empty list.

