When sharing resources with AWS services, use service principals. Service principals follow the pattern `service-id.amazonaws.com` (e.g., `pca-connector-ad.amazonaws.com`, `elasticmapreduce.amazonaws.com`). The <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`sources`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Sources`" pulumi-lang-go="`sources`" pulumi-lang-python="`sources`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`sources`" pulumi-lang-java="`sources`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`sources`">`sources`</span> argument can be used to restrict which AWS accounts the service can access the shared resources from.

