aws:securityhub/connectorV2:ConnectorV2.description:
Manages a Security Hub V2 connector.

> **NOTE:** Connectors must be created in the aggregation (home) region. A Security Hub V2 Aggregator (<span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`aws.securityhub.AggregatorV2`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`aws.securityhub.AggregatorV2`" pulumi-lang-go="`securityhub.AggregatorV2`" pulumi-lang-python="`securityhub.AggregatorV2`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`aws.securityhub.AggregatorV2`" pulumi-lang-java="`aws.securityhub.AggregatorV2`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`aws_securityhub_aggregator_v2`">`aws.securityhub.AggregatorV2`</span>) must exist before creating connectors.

> **NOTE:** After creation, the connector will be in `PENDING_AUTHORIZATION` status. Use the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`authUrl`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`AuthUrl`" pulumi-lang-go="`authUrl`" pulumi-lang-python="`auth_url`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`authUrl`" pulumi-lang-java="`authUrl`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`auth_url`">`authUrl`</span> output to complete the OAuth authorization flow.

