Using `pulumi import`, import SQS Queues using the queue <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`url`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Url`" pulumi-lang-go="`url`" pulumi-lang-python="`url`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`url`" pulumi-lang-java="`url`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`url`">`url`</span>. For example:

