### With Managed Policy Attachment

> Because destruction of a managed policy attachment resource also re-provisions the associated permission set to all accounts, explicitly indicating the dependency with the account assignment resource via the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`dependsOn`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`DependsOn`" pulumi-lang-go="`dependsOn`" pulumi-lang-python="`depends_on`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`dependsOn`" pulumi-lang-java="`dependsOn`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`depends_on`">`dependsOn`</span> meta argument is necessary to ensure proper deletion order when these resources are used together.

