aws:cloudfront/getLogDeliveryCanonicalUs.description:
The CloudFront Log Delivery Canonical User ID data source allows access to the [canonical user ID](http://docs.aws.amazon.com/general/latest/gr/acct-identifiers.html) of the AWS <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`awslogsdelivery`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`Awslogsdelivery`" pulumi-lang-go="`awslogsdelivery`" pulumi-lang-python="`awslogsdelivery`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`awslogsdelivery`" pulumi-lang-java="`awslogsdelivery`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`awslogsdelivery`">`awslogsdelivery`</span> account for CloudFront bucket logging.
