Generates an Route53 traffic policy document in JSON format for use with resources that expect policy documents such as <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`aws.route53.TrafficPolicy`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`aws.route53.TrafficPolicy`" pulumi-lang-go="`route53.TrafficPolicy`" pulumi-lang-python="`route53.TrafficPolicy`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`aws.route53.TrafficPolicy`" pulumi-lang-java="`aws.route53.TrafficPolicy`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`aws_route53_traffic_policy`">`aws.route53.TrafficPolicy`</span>.

